 272:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 273:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval IfxCpu_Id Resource index of the CPU. Range: \ref IfxCpu_Id.
