 284:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to initialize the context save area of the CPU where this is called.
 285:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 286:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API can initialize the CSA of the host CPU where this API is called. This API
 287:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * shall not be used to initialize the CSA of another CPU.
