 407:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to Restore the state of CPU interrupts.
 408:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 409:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API can be used only to disable the global interrupts of caller CPU. It cannot be
