 589:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * TRUE: Enable the performance counter.
 590:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * FALSE: Disable the performance counter.
